#1258: FILE: kernel/cgroup/cgroup.c:609:
+		if (!((css) = cgroup_e_css(cgrp, cgroup_subsys[(ssid)]))) \

Do not use assignments in if condition.
Example::

  if ((foo = bar(...)) < BAZ) {

should be written as::

  foo = bar(...);
  if (foo < BAZ) {

